  "releaseNotes": "# DripSharp.PdfCarton 3.0.8-alpha.5\n\nFix font initialization when `user.home` is empty: cache selection falls back to `java.io.tmpdir`, following Java 17 file behavior. Empty and malformed Java paths now survive internal construction until the relevant filesystem operation. Whitespace remains part of the pathname.\n\nExisting public `System.IO.FileInfo` signatures are preserved. Exporting an internal Java path that .NET cannot represent throws `ArgumentException`; it is never replaced with another path or null.",
